flowchart TD
  S([Proposal passes screening]) --> SPLIT{{Start review: 2 parallel tracks}}
  SPLIT --> C1[Content track<br/>Sub-committee writes comments, no scoring]
  SPLIT --> F0[Finance track<br/>unclaimed in finance queue]
  F0 -->|Finance staff clicks Claim| F1[Bound as permanent finance reviewer<br/>across all revision cycles]
  F0 -.->|Reviewer unavailable: Ops Admin Reassign| F0
  F1 --> F2[Verify budget lines against documents, audit note]
  C1 --> CR{Content result}
  F2 --> FR{Finance result}
  CR -->|Approved| LOCKC[Content fields become Read-Only]
  FR -->|Approved| LOCKF[Finance and budget fields become Read-Only]
  CR -->|Revise| REV[Researcher opens revision]
  FR -->|Revise| REV
  REV --> FL[FormLockEngine: lock fields of Approved tracks]
  FL --> RS[Researcher resubmits]
  RS --> TRR[TrackRouter: route only non-approved tracks<br/>back to original reviewers]
  TRR --> CR
  TRR --> FR
  LOCKC --> JOIN{Both tracks Approved?}
  LOCKF --> JOIN
  JOIN -->|yes| READY([Status = Ready for Executive Committee])
